#HSSS 1.0
TITLE: Ubuntu White Edition / Bash Specification
PACKAGE: bash
LANGUAGE: C, shell
STATUS: W1
ROLE: Interactive shell and shell scripting environment

## PROGRAM
Bash supplies interactive command execution and scripting used by users and system components.

## STRUCTURE
SOURCE: upstream Bash source/package
BOUNDARY: terminal/session -> shell parser -> builtin/external commands -> environment/processes
WHITE_EDITION: configuration and documentation layer
GUI: optional terminal/admin frontend; Bash semantics remain authoritative

## SPEC
- preserve Bash language compatibility
- keep startup behavior deterministic
- distinguish interactive configuration from system service execution
- document White Edition shell configuration

## QUALITY
TEST: upstream regressions, interactive startup, noninteractive scripts, clean-user environment, maintainer-script compatibility

## SOURCE POLICY
Do not create a White Edition shell dialect. Native C changes require a demonstrated defect and regression coverage.
